.TH QJAVA-MIGRATE-IMPORTS 1 "September 2026" "Qore JNI"
.SH NAME
qjava-migrate-imports \- migrate legacy Qore Java imports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qjava-migrate-imports
[options] path ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrates legacy Java import declarations to the dynamic Qore import syntax.
.SH OPTIONS
Run --help for migration modes and file selection. Review source changes before committing them.
.PP
Run the command with --help for the full option list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
